      "title": "Alaska Airlines reveals 'Our Commitment' aircraft in partnership with UNCF (photo 210416_OC_004hr)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-28",
      "note": "The press release's photo (mma.prnewswire.com/media/1499222/210416_OC_004hr.jpg): the right side from ahead, sunlit. Mandela's quote and the profiles measured from it, registered by the forward door, both overwing exits and the aft door; heights below the door sills scaled to the body's belly."
